        "backstory": {
          "v": "Einfall maintains the HyperNorm signal station from a doorway that has never afforded a clear view. A card allowing an idea to remain tentative produces a delighted squint: a thought is either announced or wasted. Hunky & Dory praise initiative. She touches her cheek before raising the little flag, briefly keeping one discovery entirely to herself.",
          "src": "UNION_SOLDIERS_6_2026-11-05/PRODUCTION_RECORD.json",
          "status": "DESIGN"
        },
        "frizzlebob": {
          "v": "Der Einfall ist eingetroffen. Die Bekanntgabe wartet auf Sichtkontakt.",
          "src": "UNION_SOLDIERS_6_2026-11-05/PRODUCTION_RECORD.json",
